---
to: "infrastructure/data/transactional/residency_inventory.md"
force: true
sparql:
  programs: |
    PREFIX f5dr: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/fortune5-data-residency#>
    SELECT ?programId ?catalogGroup ?catalogVersion ?directActuation
    WHERE {
      ?p a f5dr:ResidencyProgram ;
         f5dr:programId ?programId ;
         f5dr:catalogGroup ?catalogGroup ;
         f5dr:catalogVersion ?catalogVersion ;
         f5dr:directActuation ?directActuation .
    }
    ORDER BY ?programId
  policies: |
    PREFIX f5dr: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/fortune5-data-residency#>
    PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
    SELECT ?policyId ?title ?dataClassId ?homeId ?allowedId ?regionId ?provider
           ?forbidXBorder ?evidence ?directActuation
    WHERE {
      ?pol a f5dr:ResidencyPolicy ;
           f5dr:policyId ?policyId ;
           f5dr:title ?title ;
           f5dr:appliesToDataClass ?dc ;
           f5dr:homeJurisdiction ?home ;
           f5dr:allowedJurisdiction ?allowed ;
           f5dr:pinnedRegion ?pin ;
           f5dr:forbidCrossBorderReplication ?forbidXBorder ;
           f5dr:evidenceRequired ?evidence ;
           f5dr:directActuation ?directActuation .
      ?dc f5dr:dataClassId ?dataClassId .
      ?home f5dr:jurisdictionId ?homeId .
      ?allowed f5dr:jurisdictionId ?allowedId .
      ?pin f5dr:regionId ?regionId ;
          f5dr:provider ?provider .
    }
    ORDER BY ?policyId
---
# Fortune 5 data-residency inventory

Projection from `fortune5-data-residency-pack`. Catalog group `transaction-data`
(commonPack). Broker-only — no cloud actuation, no secrets.

## Programs

| programId | catalogGroup | catalogVersion | directActuation |
|---|---|---|---|
